<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="margin:0; padding:32px; background:#0f172a; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; color:#e2e8f0;">
    <div style="max-width:560px; margin:auto; padding:28px; background:#111827; border-radius:16px;">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 16px; color:#22d3ee;">New tutorial enrollment request</h2>
      <p>A learner submitted payment proof and is waiting for admin approval.</p>
      <p><strong>Student:</strong> {{studentName}}</p>
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> {{studentEmail}}</p>
      <p><strong>Course:</strong> {{courseName}}</p>
      <p><strong>Amount:</strong> PKR {{amount}}</p>
      <p><strong>Payment method:</strong> {{paymentMethod}}</p>
      <p>Please open the tutorial management area to review the uploaded screenshot.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
